    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuzakuthi lapho usufikile elizweni iNkosi uNkulunkulu wakho ekunika lona ukuba libe ngelakho, usuwakhile kulo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "uthathe ingxenye yezithelo zonke zokuqala zomhlaba ozakuzivuna elizweni lakho iNkosi uNkulunkulu wakho ekunika lona, uyifake esitsheni, uye endaweni iNkosi uNkulunkulu wakho ezakuyikhetha ukuba idunyiselwe kiyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.23.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Eks 23:19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uzakuya kumpristi ozakuba ekhona ngalesosikhathi uthi kuye: Ngiyabika eNkosini uNkulunkulu wakho lamuhla ukuthi sengifikile elizweni iNkosi eyafunga kubokhokho bethu ukusinika lona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umpristi uzakwamukela isitsha esandleni sakho, asibeke phambi kwealtare leNkosi uNkulunkulu wakho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wena uzakutsho phambi kweNkosi uNkulunkulu wakho uthi: Ubaba wayengumAramu ozulayo, wehlela eGibithe, wahlala khona labantu abalutshwana; lapho waba yisizwe esikhulu esilamandla, esilabantu abanengi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AmaGibithe asiphatha kubi, asihlupha, asiphatha ngobugqili obunzima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sasesikhala eNkosini uNkulunkulu wabokhokho; yalizwa ilizwi lethu, yabona ukuhlupheka kwethu, lokutshikatshika kwethu, lokucindezelwa kwethu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yasikhupha eGibithe ngesandla esilamandla lengalo elamandla, langezenzo ezesabekayo, langezibonakaliso lezimangaliso; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yasiletha kulindawo, yasinika lelilizwe eligcwele uchago lenyosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khathesi ngiyaletha izithelo zokuqala zomhlaba onginike wona, Nkosi. Uzasibeka phansi isitsha phambi kweNkosi uNkulunkulu wakho, uyidumise; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "uthokoze ngakho konke okuhle iNkosi uNkulunkulu wakho ekunike khona wena labendlu yakho, uthabe kanye lomLevi lowemzini ohlala lawe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lapho usuqedile ukunika okwetshumi kwezithelo zakho ngomnyaka wesithathu, ongumnyaka wokunika okwetshumi, usukunike umLevi lowemzini lentandane lomfelwakazi ukuba badle basuthe emizini yakho,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.14.28"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Dute 14:28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.14.29"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "29",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "uzakuthi phambi kweNkosi uNkulunkulu wakho: Sengikhuphile endlini yami okwetshumi okwahlukaniselwa wena, ngakunika lowemzini lentandane lomfelwakazi njengayo yonke imilayo yakho ongitshele yona; kangiweqanga lowodwa umlayo wakho, futhi kangiyikuyikhohlwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kangidlanga lokukodwa okwetshumi lapho bengilila, kangikuthathanga lapho bengingcolile, kangikunikelanga kofileyo; ngililalele ilizwi leNkosi uNkulunkulu wami, ngenzile njengokungilaya kwakho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khangela phansi usendaweni yakho engcwele esezulwini, ubusise abantu bakho uIsrayeli lomhlaba osinike wona, njengokufunga kwakho kubokhokho bethu, ilizwe eligcwele uchago lenyosi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lamhla iNkosi uNkulunkulu wenu iyalilaya ukuba lenze lezizimiso lezahlulelo; ngakhoke zigcineni kuhle ngenhliziyo yenu yonke langomphefumulo wenu wonke. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lamhla livumile ukuthi iNkosi inguNkulunkulu wenu, lokuthi lizakuhamba endleleni zayo, ligcine izimiso zayo lemilayo yayo lezahlulelo zayo, lilalele ilizwi layo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Futhi iNkosi ilamukele lamhla ukuthi lina lingabantu abaligugu layo njengokulithembisa kwayo, lokuthi lifanele ukugcina yonke imilayo yayo,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.18"
            ]
          }
        },
