          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ukuba iliphakamise phezu kwezizwe zonke ezenzileyo ngokubongwa, langodumo langokudunyiswa, libe ngabantu abangcwele eNkosini uNkulunkulu wenu njengokutsho kwayo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
